  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://ipn.anti-ad.org/assets/static/Inventory_Profiles_Next_Bg1line.png\" width=\"800px\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://discord.gg/23YCxmveUM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/861171785897738240?style=plastic&logo=discord&label=discord&link=https://discord.gg/23YCxmveUM\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/495267?style=plastic&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/inventory-profiles-next?style=plastic&logo=modrinth&link=https://modrinth.com/mod/inventory-profiles-next\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\"> <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/source-code-blue?style=plastic&logo=github\" alt=\"静态徽章\"></a></p>\n</div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">此模组将：</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">帮助你整理背包</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">修复你半损坏的工具</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">一键清空物品到目标箱子</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">移动你手中已有的、且箱内也存在的物品&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">锁定物品栏位，使整理时忽略它们</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">保持锁定栏位为空</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">允许你按 R+C 设置快捷指令</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">纯客户端运行，确保兼容所有环境</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://discord.gg/23YCxmveUM\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我们的 Discord 频道</a></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/all-in-one/description/output.webp\" width=\"300px\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组<strong style=\"font-size:14px\">并非</strong> <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory Tweaks</strong> 的直接替代品</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">无法让 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory Profiles Next</strong> 完全像 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory Tweaks</strong> 那样工作</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你之前使用过 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory Tweaks</strong>，则需要学习如何使用 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory Profiles Next</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">如果无法做到以上几点，你可以使用 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/invtweaks-emu-for-ipn\" rel=\"nofollow\">InvTweaks Emu for IPN</a> 来模拟“Inventory Tweaks”使用的一些快捷键。</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">喜欢这个模组吗？请考虑请我喝杯咖啡。</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">成为 Patreon 赞助者</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"background-color:dimgray\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mirinimi\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://ipn.anti-ad.org/cgi-bin/test.png\" alt=\"Patreon 标志\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">成为 GitHub 赞助者</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td><span><iframe src=\"https://github.com/sponsors/blackd/button\" height=\"35\" width=\"142\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">使用方法</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"width:100%\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cv7_vW-GIJU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">依赖项</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">Fabric</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libipn\" rel=\"nofollow\">libIPN</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">Forge</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin For Forge</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libipn\" rel=\"nofollow\">libIPN</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">警告</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">由于出现多次仅 Quilt 特有的崩溃以及一处物品复制漏洞，Quilt 的支持策略现定义如下：</p>\n<pre><code>本模组将通过提供的 Fabric 兼容性在 Quilt 上运行。\n任何无法在 Fabric 上复现的问题将以极低优先级处理。</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">参与贡献</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">如果遇到任何问题，请 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此处</a> 提交反馈</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你懂其他语言并希望协助翻译，可以 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/tree/all-in-one/common/src/main/resources/assets/inventoryprofilesnext/lang\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此处</a> 参与</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你是 Kotlin 开发者并希望参与贡献，请参阅 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles\" rel=\"nofollow\">源代码</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">许可证</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组基于 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/blob/all-in-one/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL v3 许可证</a> 分发</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</p>",
